# Where booking-link clicks are sent so they arrive as an email. Anything that
# turns an HTTP POST into a message works — a Formsubmit alias, a Web3Forms
# endpoint, a Zapier catch hook. The click is sent form-encoded, so each field
# becomes a line of the email.
#
# This value is public: .env is committed here, and the URL is compiled into
# the browser bundle either way. Use an endpoint that is harmless if strangers
# find it, and never put a secret in it.
#
# Note the site is built locally and docs/ is committed — the deploy workflow
# only uploads that folder — so changing this needs a rebuild to take effect.
VITE_BOOKING_WEBHOOK=
